<title>USA: Shoe Carnival August same store sales up.</title>
<headline>Shoe Carnival August same store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shoe Carnival Inc said Thursday its same store sales for the four weeks ended August 31 rose 2.7 percent compared with the year-ago period ended September 2, 1995.</p>
<p>Sales for the four weeks increased 12.5 percent to $26.9 million from $23.9 million.</p>
<p>Fiscal 1996 year-to-date sales rose 6.1 percent to $142.7 million from $134.5 million. Year-to-date same store sales declined 2.7 percent.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
